  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 61f09b08dffd5ae44bc8160582c5df09, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GameManager
  state: 0
  timeLimit: 900
  hazardPenalty: 30
  player: {fileID: 8823411630909385715}
  respawnPoint: {fileID: 1419440359}
  winPanel: {fileID: 6745706495811791947}
  winText: {fileID: 6745706495811791946}
  losePanel: {fileID: 6745706495811791945}
  menuScene: MainMenu
  introTitle: 11:45 PM  -  St. Jude Municipal Clocktower
  introText: 'My name is Arthur Vance.


    Three days ago an unsigned letter landed
    on my desk. Five words: Julian Cross never left the tower. Cross built this clock
    in 1996 and vanished the night it was finished.


    I broke in tonight to see
    for myself. I got as far as the study before someone hit me from behind.


    The
    door is locked from the outside. My watch says 11:45. Somewhere above me, something
    enormous is ticking.


    Whoever did this is counting on the tower to finish
    the job at midnight.'
  endingText: 'You haul on the bell rope at {0}.


    The great bell of St. Jude
    rings out fifteen minutes early. Across town, porch lights flicker on. The Midnight
    Protocol never gets its twelfth chime.


    Wedged behind the bell frame you
    find a leather satchel. Inside: blueprints, a council seal, and a ticket stub
    for the 1:45 to Ashford. Julian Cross never left the tower. Now everyone will
    know why.'
