  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 11c0f7c906d6409449e122b8bb29dd29, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteReader
  prompt: Read log
  title: Maintenance Log  -  J. Cross
  body: 'Drive train, Oct. 2nd:

    The great wheel must turn ONCE for every THREE
    turns of the drive. Get that wrong and the train jams.

    The middle wheel
    only carries the motion across. Its size changes nothing.



    The belfry hatch
    rides on the same chain as the hours. No clockwork, no hatch.



    The council''s
    men came by again today asking about the bell. I told them it rings at midnight
    like it always has. I did not tell them I built it so that anyone up there can
    ring it early.'
