  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 11c0f7c906d6409449e122b8bb29dd29, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteReader
  prompt: Read note
  title: A page nailed to the wall
  body: 'If you''re reading this, they locked you in too.



    They pulled the
    drive gear and scattered the rest so the tower would sleep until the Protocol
    wakes it at midnight. I hid the smallest one on these stairs where they''d never
    think to look.



    Get the clock running. Climb. Ring the bell before it rings
    itself, and all of St. Jude will come running up that hill.



    I was never
    going to make that train.



    - J.C.'
